8
00:00:26,484 --> 00:00:28,944
Of course. Why don't you tell me
what you're feeling?

9
00:00:29,112 --> 00:00:32,952
Okay, well, I ju... I think it's important
to remember that we move...

10
00:00:33,116 --> 00:00:38,076
(Leonard:)...at a pace that is our speed and...

11
