13
00:00:45,670 --> 00:00:47,590
(Leonard:)What's that?

14
00:00:50,383 --> 00:00:51,923
(Leonard:)Really? Right now?

15
00:00:52,969 --> 00:00:54,599
- Why not?
- I just ate.

16
00:00:54,762 --> 00:00:59,022
(Leonard:)Aren't you supposed to wait an hour?

